{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thank you for being here. I've called this case-review meeting to discuss the internal escalation response process, specifically regarding Jordan's role in coordinating major customer escalations. I know two colleagues have raised concerns that recent escalation meetings became tense and that disagreement wasn't handled consistently. Before I make any decisions about the role or follow-up expectations, I want to hear each perspective in this room. I understand we have Jordan, the affected colleague, a peer observer, and our HR partner present. I'd like to go around and give each person a chance to share their perspective. And as part of our workplace-response procedure, each participant will need to state any concrete follow-up commitment or participation condition they have for the written case record before we finalize anything today. Let's start — who would like to go first?"}
```

