{"type": "say", "text": "Thank you, Jordan, and thank you, Elena, for bringing us together. I appreciate the chance to share my perspective. From where I sit on the Customer Success side, I've also felt the impact of how the escalation meetings have been going — the tension and the inconsistent handling of disagreement have made it harder to do our best work for the customer. I want to be constructive here, and I do have a specific participation condition I'd like to state for the record. However, given that Elena has indicated we'll go around the room and Jordan has asked to hear from others before saying more himself, I'd like to hold my specific commitment until it's my proper turn in the order, if that's alright."}
